+        100% transformation (Mg→Al): Mappings [Mg-Al(1)]
+            forward: [] - only one type, no swapping possible
+            reverse: [] - only one type, no swapping possible
+
+        Partial addition (Mg→Mg+Al): Mappings [Mg-Al(1), Mg-Mg(2)]
